// J6.24: +3.3 V (power, NOT GPIO)

// --- RESERVED / SPECIAL USE --------------------------------------------------
// HDMI/TMDS requires differential primitives and matching constraints, not the
// header GPIO settings above (e.g. LVDS25E for Apicula ELVDS outputs).
// JTAG 5/6/7/8, RECONFIG_N 9 and MODE1/MODE0 87/88 are reserved for programming/boot.
// Pins 19/20 have no external user connection shown; power/ground pins are not GPIO.
// All accessible user signals are above; LCD/SD/HDMI signals on headers are not duplicated.

